    "collection": "Flutter SchedulerBinding.addTimingsCallback. Match FrameTiming.frameNumber to the scenario interval. Nearest-rank p50 and p95 and maximum are milliseconds. Either-stage over-budget count uses build or raster greater than 16,667 microseconds.",
