    "limits": "Stage timing covers Flutter build and raster work. Display presentation, input latency, dropped vsyncs and other platforms were not measured. Small first-open samples have substantial variance. Repeated run order can warm caches across versions. The data do not isolate shader compilation or asset decode costs."
